      "description": "Scan a chapter (or the whole paper) for propositions/theorems/lemmas that overlap structurally — same boxed equation under different parametrisations, near-identical proof skeletons, explicit \"specialisation of\"/\"case of\"/\"corollary of\" wording in `.md`, or high-overlap on (uses, cites, tags). Reports candidates for consolidation: parent → corollary, true duplicates, mergeable statements. Run after large-scale chapter work or when the user notices the exposition has accreted special cases.",
